Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared value as 0.
Keep a shared foundat as 0.
Keep a shared leftvalue as 0.
Keep a shared rightvalue as 0.
Keep a shared lastfirst as 0.
Keep a shared lastsecond as 0.
Keep a shared firsts as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared seconds as an empty list of text.
To parse from spot (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If spot is more than finish, return.
The digit is the digit value of character spot of current.
Set value to value times 10 plus digit.
Parse from spot plus 1 with finish.

To parse segment.
The finish is the last position of current.
Parse from 0 with finish.

To read left at spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than lastfirst, return.
Set current to item spot of firsts.
Set value to 0.
Parse segment.
Set leftvalue to value.

To read right at spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than lastsecond, return.
Set current to item spot of seconds.
Set value to 0.
Parse segment.
Set rightvalue to value.

The first is "1.01".
The second is "1.001".
The firstparts is split first by ".".
The secondparts is split second by ".".
For each part in firstparts.
Place part into firsts.

For each part in secondparts.
Place part into seconds.

The endfirst is the last position of firsts.
The endsecond is the last position of seconds.
Set lastfirst to endfirst.
Set lastsecond to endsecond.
The result is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 2.
Set leftvalue to 0.
Set rightvalue to 0.
If spot is at most lastfirst, read left at spot.
If spot is at most lastsecond, read right at spot.
If result is 0 and leftvalue is less than rightvalue, set result to -1.
If result is 0 and leftvalue is more than rightvalue, set result to 1.

Show result.
